 join, key in the arms                           | scope read, 1 keys, per pair                                                                                                                                                                                 | t
 join, member alone, two keys                    | scope read, 2 keys, once                                                                                                                                                                                     | t
 join, other columns projected                   | join, the union projects other columns than the member and the key of the pairs                                                                                                                              | t
 join, two keys                                  | scope read, 2 keys, per pair                                                                                                                                                                                 | t
 join, union                                     | scope read, 1 keys, per pair                                                                                                                                                                                 | t
 join, view                                      | scope read, 1 keys, per pair                                                                                                                                                                                 | t
 join, view with the key first                   | scope read, 1 keys, per pair                                                                                                                                                                                 | t
